### Finishing

Rubio natural, yellowish color which is what we expected

Not easy to choose a color from the website, despite them having a color chart. You don't know in avance which effect it will have on each wood. Maybe they hav a kind of simulator.

Also for the quantity.

Bought the sponge to apply it.

acheter-rubio.fr

except a few issues with delivery where i received no parcel collection code as there was no phone number nor any email associated with the order. Imposile to join on chat, and no answer to email.
Still it seems the vendor is serious and parcel was re-sent. Still it took quite a few days.

small batches

Good thing is that you can easily sand any part and reapply the rubio without any visible delimitation.

i had to do it after revealing glue marks.

Very happy with the result, easy to apply, 
light sanding after with 000 steel whool, and perfect rendering.

Approx 3/4 of the small bottle.

only issue is the smell for several days.

